These files were written and tested against Express 4, helmet 8, express-rate-limit 8, zod 4, pg 8 and Node 22.23 (15 passing tests, below). Put them where the structure tree says. Do not "simplify" them; if a newer library version needs a different call, change that call and keep the behaviour.

