**Forms and server**
13. Both forms validate in both languages with the shared schemas, show errors per field, submit once, and store exactly one row per submit even with a double click; the honeypot stores nothing; a stopped database gives the localised "unavailable" text while the rest of the site works; the 11th post in 15 minutes shows the generic error.
